                      "\n\t<i>“Did you find something?”</i>\n\t\n\tPaulette shakes her head. <i>“Not a damn thing. I investigated all of the Stacks without finding anything linked to the E.G.G. or GUs. I swear, it wasn’t just a nightmare — everything was so real, so visceral, so-”</i>\n\t\n\t<i>“We’ll unveil the truth. I’m sure of it,”</i> you reply. <i>“You can’t give up now.”</i>\n\t\n\tThe former XO nods. <i>“Yes. Thank you [pc.name], for everything.”</i> \n\t",
